WEBVTT

00:04:29.895 --> 00:04:33.879
it just sees millions
and even billions of pictures,

00:04:33.903 --> 00:04:37.434
and learns what it is
that makes a cat a cat.

00:04:37.458 --> 00:04:43.582
And it doesn't really use human
abstractions or features,

00:04:43.606 --> 00:04:48.717
and it's just looking
at a thousand-dimensional space

00:04:48.741 --> 00:04:52.415
and drawing a thousand-dimensional curve

00:04:52.439 --> 00:04:55.859
that separates what is a cat
from what isn't.

00:04:55.883 --> 00:05:00.732
And that curve is really hard
for humans to comprehend.